# CR 702.16k, 613.1b: "You" in "You have protection from each of your opponents" is Absolute Virtue's controller, as control
# is now. On turn 4 Bot2 gains control of Bot1's Absolute Virtue with Act of Treason: now Bot2 has protection from Bot1 and
# Bot1 has none. Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets Bot1 (cast); Bot1's Lightning Bolt can't target Bot2 (refusal) but targets
# Absolute Virtue (the positive control, with the same red mana). The hasty Virtue attacks Bot1 for 8, which nothing
# prevents.

